@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 管理员强制结束充电时序图

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "充电控制器" as Ctrl
participant "充电服务" as Service
participant "支付服务" as Pay
database 数据库 as DB

Admin -> FE: 选择强制结束充电\n填写强制终止原因
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/charges/{id}/force-stop\n{reason: "设备异常发热"}
note right FE : ApiService.forceStop()\n请求自动附加 JWT Token\n仅管理员/最高管理者可调用

Ctrl -> Service: forceStop(recordId, reason)

group 权限校验
  Service -> Service: 校验当前用户角色 (hasRole('ADMIN') or hasRole('SUPER_ADMIN'))
end

Service -> DB: SELECT cr.*, c.status\nFROM charge_records cr\nJOIN chargers c ON cr.charger_id = c.id\nWHERE cr.id = ? FOR UPDATE -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，带行锁
DB --> Service: 充电记录、桩状态

alt 记录状态为 processing（充电中）
  group 事务 [atomic] 覆盖: 更新充电记录 + 扣减余额 + 插入支付记录 + 释放桩 + 审计日志
    Service -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(), energy_kwh=0, fee=0, status='completed' WHERE id = ? AND status='processing'
    DB --> Service: 强制结束成功

    Service -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'idle' WHERE id = ? AND status != 'fault'
    DB --> Service: 桩已释放

    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, payload)\nVALUES (?, 'admin', 'force_stop', 'charge_record', ?, ?::jsonb)
    note right DB : payload 中记录强制终止原因\n如: {"reason": "设备异常发热"}
    DB --> Service: 审计日志记录成功
  end

  Service --> Ctrl: 强制结束成功
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 JSON {status: 'force_stopped', reason}
  FE --> Admin: 显示"已强制结束充电，原因已记录"
else 记录状态不为 processing
  Service --> Ctrl: 该记录无需强制终止
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 409 Conflict {error: "记录状态不允许强制终止"}
  FE --> Admin: 显示"该充电记录无需强制终止"
end
@enduml